      "message": "addrman: add networks filter to SelectTriedCollision\n\nIf networks is non-empty, SelectTriedCollision() starts at a random\ncollision and returns the first one whose to-be-evicted entry is on one\nof the given networks, or nothing if there is none. Skipped collisions\nare kept.",
      "committer": {
